@* What a card shows in place of its note when JAStudio has no note with the card's note id: the note was deleted in JAStudio while its Anki note, with
   its cards and their review history, was kept. *@
<div class="note-not-in-jastudio">
    <p>This card's note no longer exists in JAStudio. It was deleted, and its Anki note was kept, with its review history.</p>
    <p>Note id: @NoteId</p>
</div>

@code {
    /// <summary>The id of the card's note, as Anki passed it to the card.</summary>
    [Parameter, EditorRequired] public string? NoteId { get; set; }
}
